<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link><description>World News Today: Read the latest world news headlines, Current International breaking news world wide. In depth analysis and top news headlines world wide.</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-04-11T07:17:52+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/296589292.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Sat, 11 Apr 2026 07:17:52 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link></image><item><title><![CDATA['Entire trip was spectacular': Trump hails Artemis II crew, eyes Mars next]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130182688.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Artemis II astronauts have successfully returned to Earth after a historic lunar flyby, setting a new distance record. President Trump lauded the crew's achievement and declared Mars as the next frontier for human space exploration. This mission tested crucial deep-space systems, paving the way for future lunar landings and ambitious journeys to the Red Planet.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/entire-trip-was-spectacular-trump-hails-artemis-ii-crew-after-historic-moon-mission-eyes-mars-next/articleshow/130182688.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/entire-trip-was-spectacular-trump-hails-artemis-ii-crew-after-historic-moon-mission-eyes-mars-next/articleshow/130182688.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-11T06:42:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130182714,imgsize-141688.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[4,430 OPTs only in Missouri; janitorial services training: US senator reveals 'visa abuse' facts]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130179889.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/4430-opt-only-in-missouri-janitorial-services-training-us-senator-reveals-visa-abuse-facts/articleshow/130179889.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/4430-opt-only-in-missouri-janitorial-services-training-us-senator-reveals-visa-abuse-facts/articleshow/130179889.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-11T02:18:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130179899,imgsize-25392.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Ninja takes indefinite streaming break, blames Arc Raiders hackers]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130179851.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Popular streamer Ninja has announced an indefinite break from streaming, citing extreme frustration with rampant cheating and stream sniping in Arc Raiders.  He described the game as 'literally unplayable' due to hackers exploiting his stream to gain an unfair advantage.  Despite developer promises, the persistent issue is driving away dedicated players and threatening the game's future.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/ninja-takes-indefinite-streaming-break-blames-arc-raiders-hackers/articleshow/130179851.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/ninja-takes-indefinite-streaming-break-blames-arc-raiders-hackers/articleshow/130179851.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-11T02:09:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sumit Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130179861,imgsize-623085.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Run again!' Kamala Harris confirms she's thinking about running for president again in 2028]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130179825.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/run-again-kamala-harris-confirms-shes-thinking-about-running-for-president-again-in-2028/articleshow/130179825.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/run-again-kamala-harris-confirms-shes-thinking-about-running-for-president-again-in-2028/articleshow/130179825.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-11T02:00:23+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130179828,imgsize-72700.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[How BBC recreated a highly controversial 1974 psychology prison experiment to test human obedience]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130174025.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The BBC once revisited the Stanford Prison Experiment through a controlled 2002 prison simulation to test how authority forms under structured conditions. While Zimbardo’s original study suggested roles alone could drive conformity and tyranny, the BBC experiment found authority depended more on group identity and cohesion, with guards struggling and prisoners resisting. Both studies remain influential but limited by lack of ecological validity.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/how-bbc-recreated-a-highly-controversial-1974-psychology-prison-experiment-to-test-human-obedience/articleshow/130174025.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/how-bbc-recreated-a-highly-controversial-1974-psychology-prison-experiment-to-test-human-obedience/articleshow/130174025.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-11T01:54:55+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130179771,imgsize-481277.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Prince Harry sued for defamation by Africa charity he co-founded in honour of late mother Princess Diana]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130179677.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/prince-harry-sued-for-defamation-by-africa-charity-he-co-founded-in-honour-of-late-mother-princess-diana/articleshow/130179677.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/prince-harry-sued-for-defamation-by-africa-charity-he-co-founded-in-honour-of-late-mother-princess-diana/articleshow/130179677.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-11T01:51:59+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130179677,imgsize-63610.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Melania has a team of lawyers ready to go, says adviser about sudden Epstein statement that even Trump wa