legal status on drivers' licenses from 2027: US citizen or legal immigrant]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130178204.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/florida-to-add-legal-status-on-drivers-licenses-from-2027-us-citizen-or-legal-immigrant/articleshow/130178204.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/florida-to-add-legal-status-on-drivers-licenses-from-2027-us-citizen-or-legal-immigrant/articleshow/130178204.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-11T00:00:43+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130178287,imgsize-88460.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Jasontheween’s livestream takes sudden turn after giveaway car is reported stolen and search begins]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130174799.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Jasontheween claimed during an April 9 livestream that his giveaway car was stolen, but many fans questioned the story. While he shared security footage and later posted the license plate online, doubts about the incident quickly spread. The situation remains unclear, with no official confirmation, as online reactions continue to focus on whether the event was real or staged.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/jasontheweens-livestream-takes-sudden-turn-after-giveaway-car-is-reported-stolen-and-search-begins/articleshow/130174799.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/jasontheweens-livestream-takes-sudden-turn-after-giveaway-car-is-reported-stolen-and-search-begins/articleshow/130174799.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-